## AI GIRLFRIEND

I know what you’re thinking — “Bro is really leaning into the stereotypes.”  
But gimme a second.

This whole thing started as a way for me to sharpen my JavaScript skills. The idea itself is… let’s say unconventional, but I had a bunch($5) of leftover OpenAI API tokens and figured it’d be a waste not to experiment with something fun.

I just wrapped up an e‑commerce project, so I thought: why not build something in the same language, with similar logic, but way more entertaining?  
And that’s how the “AI Girlfriend” project was born.

I’m keeping it simple — Express, a few routes, some HTML and CSS to give the chatbot a bit of personality. Nothing wild. I’m also planning to make the code comments fun so your gooning ass doesnt fall asleep reading them.


If you are a future employer im a chill guy and this is purely for fun


